 "lq": [
  {
   "_id": 9839,
   "ANSWER": "<h3 data-end=\"146\" data-start=\"93\"><strong data-end=\"144\" data-start=\"97\">1. Definition and Role of Sockets (5 marks)</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"363\" data-start=\"147\"><strong data-end=\"170\" data-start=\"147\">Network programming</strong> allows programs to communicate over a network.<br data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"217\" />\n<strong data-end=\"231\" data-start=\"220\">Sockets</strong> are endpoints for sending/receiving data across a network using protocols like TCP or UDP. They enable client-server communication.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"363\" data-start=\"147\"><strong data-end=\"412\" data-start=\"374\">2. TCP vs UDP Comparison (6 marks)</strong></p>\n\n<table data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"416\">\n\t<thead data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"416\">\n\t\t<tr data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"416\">\n\t\t\t<th data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"432\" data-start=\"416\">Feature</th>\n\t\t\t<th data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"462\" data-start=\"432\">TCP</th>\n\t\t\t<th data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"462\">UDP</th>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t<tbody data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"572\">\n\t\t<tr data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"572\">\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"588\" data-start=\"572\">Reliability</td>\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"619\" data-start=\"588\">Reliable (connection-based)</td>\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"619\">Unreliable (connectionless)</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"651\">\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"667\" data-start=\"651\">Speed</td>\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"698\" data-start=\"667\">Slower due to checks</td>\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"729\" data-start=\"698\">Faster, no checks</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"730\">\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"746\" data-start=\"730\">Use Case</td>\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"746\">File transfer, emails</td>\n\t\t\t<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"777\">Games, video streaming</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><button></button><strong data-end=\"850\" data-start=\"819\">3. Recommendation (4 marks)</strong></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"853\"><strong data-end=\"871\" data-start=\"853\">Recommendation</strong>: Use <strong data-end=\"884\" data-start=\"877\">UDP</strong><br data-end=\"887\" data-start=\"884\" />\n<strong data-end=\"904\" data-start=\"887\">Justification</strong>:</p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"1076\" data-start=\"908\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"908\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1011\" data-start=\"910\">UDP is <strong data-end=\"927\" data-start=\"917\">faster</strong> and better for real-time games where speed matters more than guaranteed delivery.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1076\" data-start=\"1012\">\n\t<p data-end=\"1076\" data-start=\"1014\">Minor data loss is acceptable in exchange for quick responses.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC203P",
   "LEVEL": 3,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO4",
    "PLO2",
    "PLO1"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p data-end=\"445\" data-start=\"153\">You are developing a real-time multiplayer quiz game. You need to choose an appropriate socket protocol (TCP or UDP) for communication between the server and players. The system should handle fast responses with minimal delay, but also ensure messages are correctly delivered.</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"456\" data-start=\"447\"><strong data-end=\"456\" data-start=\"447\">Task:</strong></p>\n\n<ol data-end=\"782\" data-start=\"458\">\n\t<li data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"458\">\n\t<p data-end=\"544\" data-start=\"461\"><strong data-end=\"471\" data-start=\"461\">Define</strong> network programming and explain the role of sockets in it. <em data-end=\"542\" data-start=\"531\">(5 marks)</em></p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"545\">\n\t<p data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"548\"><strong data-end=\"565\" data-start=\"548\">Differentiate</strong> between TCP and UDP socket types in terms of reliability, speed, and use cases. <em data-end=\"657\" data-start=\"646\">(6 marks)</em></p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"782\" data-start=\"660\">\n\t<p data-end=\"782\" data-start=\"663\"><strong data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"663\">Recommend</strong> which protocol is better for your quiz game and justify your decision with protocol behavior. <em data-end=\"782\" data-start=\"771\">(4 marks)</em></p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p data-end=\"492\" data-start=\"153\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
